{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_03_end","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":7,"storyDependence":"act45side_level_act45side_03_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-3","storyName":"音乐室内的光芒","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"与前东家的误会一直如同阴霾一般困扰着海铃，就在她纠结于是否加入老爷的家族时，被抓的祥子点明了老爷的阴谋。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_03_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_03","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":5,"next":7,"characters":["弗朗西斯","八幡海铃","严肃的打手","苍老的声音","丰川祥子"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":9},{"type":"text","text":"一开始，我只当作接到了一份再普通不过的工作。","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"一个籍籍无名的小家族需要我的力量，以便在风雨飘摇的叙拉古站稳脚跟。","id":11},{"type":"text","text":"可随着日子一天天过去，他们越来越信任我，甚至带我参加家族的核心会议。","id":12},{"type":"text","text":"我明知这不符合最开始合同上的条款，却又很享受待在这些人中的感觉。","id":13},{"type":"dialog","id":14},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":15},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":16},{"type":"charslot","id":17},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_bg_33_g10_smallrestaurant.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":19},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"哟！海铃小妹，好几天不见了，你还好吗？","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"喏，橘子味奶冻。我没记错的话，你是喜欢这个口味吧？","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"不用，我自己有。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"*哥伦比亚粗口*，别那么不领情啊！","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"我是听说你单枪匹马，把之前骚扰我们的那帮家伙赶走了，想感谢感谢你啊！","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"离我远点。我只是个拿钱办事的打手，干完这票就会离开。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"要是等会你们老大看到我们两个混在一起，你肯定没好下场。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"没关系啦，老大上次和我说了，他早就想邀请你加入我们......","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"......建议你们还是在叙拉古多打听打听我的名声吧。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"不需要打听，你已经是我们见过的最强的人了！","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"要我说，你不如现在就答应得了。今晚家族聚餐，一起去啊——","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3","focus":"m","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"与其说是家族聚餐，不如说是乐队表演吧......","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-12$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"哎，我们家族虽然势力小了点，但成员之间的情谊是别人比不了的啊！","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"况且你不是和我们一起表演了很多次吗，大家都很默契了啊。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#3$3","focus":"m","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"......等我哪天有空再说吧。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-3$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"你之前也是这样说的——","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"走了。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":51},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":52},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":53},{"type":"charslot","id":54},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_bg_33_g11_mansionhall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":56},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":58},{"type":"text","text":"我拒绝了他的盛情邀请。","id":59},{"type":"text","text":"但回家的路上，我的心中却涌起一种莫名的感觉。","id":60},{"type":"text","text":"一种从未有过的感觉。","id":61},{"type":"text","text":"那晚，我躺在床上，辗转反侧，整夜未眠。","id":62},{"type":"text","text":"太阳还未升起之时，我就收拾好了所有的行李——","id":63},{"type":"dialog","id":64},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":65},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#6$3","focus":"m","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"......谁会找到这里？","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":69},{"type":"charslot","id":70},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":71},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的打手","text":"海铃，老爷那边出了点状况，想让你帮忙背点罪。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_699_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"可我已经决定......","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的打手","text":"监狱那边我们已经安排好了，他们正在下面等着。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_699_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的打手","text":"这些是报酬，你要是觉得不够，还可以再加。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_699_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#3$3","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"......","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-3$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的打手","text":"海铃，你今天怎么回事，是我说错什么了吗？","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_699_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的打手","text":"之前不一直都是这样吗——我们出钱，你办事。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_699_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的打手","text":"快去吧，我们会想办法帮你减到半年，半年就能出来了。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_699_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":88},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":89},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"charslot","id":91},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8d/Avg_bg_bg_cellroomC.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":93},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":95},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorclosequite","volume":"1","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":97},{"type":"bg","duration":"2","from":"0","to":"1","block":"false","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":99},{"type":"text","text":"作为被雇佣的打手，替人背罪是再正常不过的事，我对监狱的生活也再熟悉不过。","id":100},{"type":"text","text":"但这次，唯独这次，我却无比地煎熬。","id":101},{"type":"text","text":"半年里，我无时无刻不想着出狱，想回到那个家族中，回到他们的乐队派对里。","id":102},{"type":"text","text":"我已经决定好了自己的归宿。","id":103},{"type":"text","text":"可我没想到，最后的结局却是——","id":104},{"type":"dialog","id":105},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":106},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":107},{"type":"charslot","id":108},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_bg_33_g2_srcalley.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":111},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":112},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainlight_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"1","id":113},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"老大死了，大家都死了，几百号人现在只剩我们十几个了！","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗朗西斯","text":"我们一帮兄弟好不容易从哥伦比亚漂泊到这鬼地方，全栽在你一个人手上了！","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_698_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":119},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":120},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":122},{"type":"charslot","id":123},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_bg_33_g2_srcalley.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":124},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":125},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":127},{"type":"text","text":"这半年里究竟发生了什么？","id":128},{"type":"text","text":"我不知道，但我唯一知道的是——","id":129},{"type":"text","text":"我又一次失去了“家”。","id":130},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":132},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"charslot","id":135},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_bg_33_g7_reception.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":138},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":139,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"海铃，你替我做了这么多件事，卖了这么多次命，我应当给你一个身份。","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"我允许你加入我的家族。","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"......你知道我从来都是独来独往，不会加入任何一个家族。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-12$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3","focus":"n","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"是不愿，还是不能？","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"......","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3","focus":"n","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"海铃，我和那些自称“家族领袖”的地痞流氓不一样。","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"我在这个地方和那帮阴险狡诈的大家族斗了大半辈子，从来没有离开过牌桌。","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3","focus":"m","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"你希望我帮你登上更大的牌桌？","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3","focus":"n","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"你很聪明。","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3","focus":"m","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"但和做交易不一样，加入一个家族需要考虑的事情更多。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"做交易只需考虑雇主的开价，加入一个家族则要考虑领袖的人品。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3","focus":"n","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"呵呵，我知道我的风评算不上好，但这不就是我们相似的地方吗？","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"海铃，除了我，还有人愿意接纳你吗？","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#8$3","focus":"m","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"......","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":165},{"type":"charslot","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"叙拉古太危险，家族和秩序之下，全是阴谋和算计。","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"你有多久没睡过安稳觉了？","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"侧躺在纸箱上，手中还要时刻拿着匕首戒备......","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"“独狼终有归宿”。","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"是回归狼群，恢复身份和名誉......还是横尸荒野，被野兽分食。","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"你自己选择。","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#8$3","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"我......","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":175},{"type":"charslot","id":176},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":178},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的打手","text":"老爷，她引来了些不干净的人。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_699_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"charslot","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":184},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_stage","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"sw","id":185},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"2","channel":"sw","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","duration":"1","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","random":"true","power":"5","times":"45","duration":"0.5","id":189},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"祥子的双手被反铐着，动弹不得。","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_699_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的打手","text":"还有一个家伙跑了，我们正在派人追。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_699_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":194},{"type":"charslot","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"海铃，你认识这位小姐？","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"不认识。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你不记得我们的那些旧账了？","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":201},{"type":"charslot","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"看来是来寻仇的。","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"海铃，我给你时间和场地，你自己处理。","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#8$3","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"我说过了，我不认识她......","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":207},{"type":"charslot","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"这是你加入我的家族前的最后一项考验。","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苍老的声音","text":"这次......就不要拿提前准备的血袋伪装现场了。","id":210},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":212},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"charslot","id":215},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_65_i04.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"0","x":"120","y":"-30","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":217},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainheavy_loop","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"hr","id":218},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"hr","fadetime":"2.5","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":220},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loading_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":221,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordexsheath","volume":"1","id":222},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"120","yFrom":"-30","xTo":"0","yTo":"0","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"25","block":"false","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":225},{"type":"text","text":"小巷里，唯有祥子和海铃两个人。","id":226},{"type":"text","text":"但她们知道，有人正在期待这场决斗如何收场。","id":227},{"type":"text","text":"海铃知道，老爷正在看。","id":228},{"type":"text","text":"祥子知道，莫菲丝也在看。","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"我跟你无冤无仇，你何必寻死？","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我是来接你回去的。","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"接我回去？","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"不是回台球室，而是回你本应在的地方。","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"我听不懂你在说什么。","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"就算你听不懂，我也必须拉住你，不能让你就这样去寻死。","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"暗算弗朗西斯他们的人，就是老爷的手下。","id":236},{"type":"dialog","id":237},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我不相信一个背地里暗算你的人，会给你想要的归宿。","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"可是......可是......","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"无数次被人利用，无数次被当作弃子......这就是你想要的生活，这就是你想要的信任吗？","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你在这里待了这么久，甚至不愿伤害任何一个人。","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"刚才在里面，我看见了你的琴盒，里面装的，是你的贝斯吧？","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"海铃，你本无须承受这种痛苦。","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"海铃......和我一起离开吧。","id":245},{"type":"dialog","id":246},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":247},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":248},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"hr","fadetime":"2","id":249},{"type":"image","id":250},{"type":"charslot","id":251}],"characters":["弗朗西斯","八幡海铃","严肃的打手","苍老的声音","丰川祥子"]}